134	  /// `BlocConsumer<EntriesSearchCubit, ...>`'s own listener (below) — starts
135	  /// [_searchSkeletonTimer] fresh on every transition into
136	  /// `ResourceLoading`, mirroring [initState]'s one-shot [_skeletonTimer]
